Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/beadle-county"],["ARC or PLC in Beadle County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/beadle-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Beadle County came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 38 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 18% of normal in January to February and 162% in July to August. So far in 2026, February to March sat at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29229 got 48% of normal that year.</p>"}
